 will show where automation fits and which integrations need checking, rather than promise a complete replacement.","start":17.12,"end":25.04},{"speaker":"customer","text":"That is helpful. Could we review the details tomorrow afternoon?","start":26.36,"end":29.44},{"speaker":"agent","text":"Certainly, David. In this demo, we would capture those notes and request a suitable appointment.","start":29.96,"end":35.04},{"speaker":"customer","text":"Perfect. Thank you, Sarah.","start":36.4,"end":37.56}]}